DESCRIPTION:Join us for an engaging session with Aaron Matthews as he share
 s practical strategies for leveraging AI to amplify human potential and dr
 ive meaningful results in your organization. In this interactive presentat
 ion\, you'll discover how to harness AI not as a replacement for human tal
 ent\, but as a powerful tool that multiplies your team's capabilities and 
 impact. Drawing from real-world experience leading AI transformation initi
 atives across healthcare\, insurance\, financial services\, and manufactur
 ing\, Aaron will share actionable tips and proven techniques that you can 
 implement immediately. Whether you're just beginning to explore AI applica
 tions or actively managing transformation projects\, you'll walk away with
  concrete strategies to integrate AI thoughtfully into your workflows whil
 e keeping people at the center of your approach. Learn how organizations a
 re achieving dramatic productivity gains and uncovering hidden opportuniti
 es through strategic AI adoption—and how you can apply these same princi
 ples in your own context. About the Presenter: Aaron Matthews\, MBA\, PMP\
 , is a Fractional Executive (CTO/COO/Program Leader) and Founder of Value 
 Alignment Consulting LLC\, based in West Des Moines\, Iowa. With over 21 y
 ears of leadership experience spanning healthcare IT\, insurance technolog
 y\, financial services\, SaaS\, and AI implementation\, Aaron helps organi
 zations navigate digital transformation while keeping people—not just te
 chnology—at the center of the strategy. Aaron currently leads complex pr
 ojects including AI transformation initiatives at Hexion\, a 150-year-old 
 chemical company undergoing major modernization backed by significant priv
 ate equity investment. He manages the full portfolio of internal AI projec
 ts\, bridging enterprise program management with emerging AI strategy at s
 cale. Prior to his current work\, Aaron spent 17 years in healthcare IT\, 
 including roles at Cerner Corporation and Munson Healthcare\, where he reb
 uilt PMOs\, implemented governance frameworks\, and delivered measurable r
 esults—from a 96% increase in developer throughput to discovering over $
 1.2M in operational savings. He also served as Technical Program Manager a
 t Overjet.ai\, an AI-driven dental claims processing company\, giving him 
 early\, hands-on experience with enterprise AI before the current wave. Aa
 ron's leadership philosophy is rooted in servant leadership\, LEAN princip
 les\, and a deep belief in the infinite potential of every person. His mis
 sion: use technology as a force multiplier for human capability - not a re
 placement for it.  
DTEND:20260219T183000Z
DTSTAMP:20261012T134428Z
DTSTART:20260219T173000Z
