DESCRIPTION: AI as Your BA Partner: Plan Faster. Lead Smarter. Deliver Bett
 er. AI can bring speed\, structure\, and fresh ideas\, but you bring the e
 xperience\, judgment\, leadership\, and credibility that move a project fo
 rward. This session puts the project manager firmly in control and shows h
 ow AI can strengthen the work without replacing the person behind it. Atte
 ndees will see practical ways to use AI for project plans\, roadmaps\, bud
 gets\, risk matrices\, status updates\, stakeholder communication\, and de
 cision support. The goal is simple: reduce busywork\, improve clarity\, an
 d help project managers lead with greater confidence and deliver stronger 
 results. Speaker Bio Angie Weller is a product\, business analysis\, and d
 elivery leader with more than 15 years of experience turning complex busin
 ess needs into actionable plans and measurable results. Her background inc
 ludes Agile leadership\, project and product delivery\, stakeholder alignm
 ent\, roadmaps\, budgeting\, risk management\, process improvement\, and l
 arge-scale technology transformation. Angie is actively involved in Centra
 l Iowa’s business analysis and project management communities and is pas
 sionate about helping professionals use AI to work smarter while keeping h
 uman judgment\, personality\, and leadership at the core.   
