 .blob.core.windows.net/00000400579/Images/2026_07_27_14_48_391.png" width=
 "432" /></div>\n\n<div><u><strong>AI as Your BA Partner: Plan Faster. Lead
  Smarter. Deliver Better.</strong></u></div>\n\n<div>\n<p>AI can bring spe
 ed\, structure\, and fresh ideas\, but you bring the experience\, judgment
 \, leadership\, and credibility that move a project forward. This session 
 puts the project manager firmly in control and shows how AI can strengthen
  the work without replacing the person behind it.</p>\n\n<p>Attendees will
  see practical ways to use AI for project plans\, roadmaps\, budgets\, ris
 k matrices\, status updates\, stakeholder communication\, and decision sup
 port. The goal is simple: reduce busywork\, improve clarity\, and help pro
 ject managers lead with greater confidence and deliver stronger results.</
 p>\n\n<p><strong>Speaker Bio</strong></p>\n\n<p>Angie Weller is a product\
 , business analysis\, and delivery leader with more than 15 years of exper
 ience turning complex business needs into actionable plans and measurable 
 results. Her background includes Agile leadership\, project and product de
 livery\, stakeholder alignment\, roadmaps\, budgeting\, risk management\, 
 process improvement\, and large-scale technology transformation.</p>\n\n<p
 >Angie is actively involved in Central Iowa’s business analysis and proj
 ect management communities and is passionate about helping professionals u
 se AI to work smarter while keeping human judgment\, personality\, and lea
 dership at the core.&nbsp\;</p>\n</div>\n
